organisers. <a href=\"#217284c6-2071-4977-a9be-562af6ddc723-link\" aria-label=\"Jump to footnote reference 2\">\u21a9\ufe0e<\/a><\/li><\/ol>","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We have updated the full paper submission deadlines for SWAT4HCLS 2024 The original paper deadline of Tuesday November 28 is now our pre-submission deadline. We encourage you to submit a prefinal draft now or at least on or before this &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/news\/leiden-2024\/deadlines-swat4hcls-2024-updated\/\">Continue reading <span class=\"meta-nav\">&rarr;<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":4,"featured_media":4280,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":"[{\"content\":\"Thanks to those who spotted that November 26 is not a Tuesday. We corrected it to November 28. Apologies for the mistake.\",\"id\":\"ad4995c8-27f0-40d0-9be1-ad40003f9ed0\"},{\"content\":\"Note that the submission form allows you to add comments for the organisers.\",\"id\":\"217284c6-2071-4977-a9be-562af6ddc723\"}]"},"categories":[30],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4414","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-leiden-2024"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4414","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/4"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4414"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4414\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":4416,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4414\/revisions\/4416"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"hre